{"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"@frozen","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"DijkstraSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Weight","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Vertex","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Edge","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Hashable","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each source is discovered first, at distance zero. Then, while a discovered vertex is not yet","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"settled, the one with the smallest distance is examined (settled at that distance), and each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of its out-edges is examined in turn with the distance it offers its target: the examined","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"vertex’s distance plus the edge’s weight. An edge into an unsettled target is then relaxed,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"when the offer is smaller than the target’s distance or the target was not yet discovered, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not relaxed. A relaxed edge to an undiscovered target is followed by that target’s discovery.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"An edge into a settled vertex, a self-loop included, is examined and nothing more. After its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"last out-edge the examined vertex is finished. Vertices the sources do not reach are never","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reported.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent"},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Enumeration","modules":[{"name":"ShortestPaths"}],"symbolKind":"enum","title":"DijkstraSearchEvent","externalID":"s:13ShortestPaths19DijkstraSearchEventO","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"DijkstraSearchEvent"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"DijkstraSearchEvent","kind":"identifier"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearch.swift#L17","fileName":"DijkstraSearch.swift"}},"abstract":[{"text":"What a Dijkstra search reports, in order, with the events of the Boost Graph Library’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Dijkstra visitor.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/shortestpaths\/dijkstrasearchevent"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SQ","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/SH","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To","kind":"relationships"}],"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumeration-Cases","identifiers":["doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\/ShortestPaths\/DijkstraSearchEvent\/discover(_:distance:)","doc:\/\/ShortestPaths\/documentation\